    "title": "John Strickland tops field at Zionsville Sprint Triathlon on Aug. 30, 2026",
    "text": "John Strickland tops field at Zionsville Sprint Triathlon on Aug. 30, 2026\nJohn Strickland won the Zionsville Sprint Triathlon on Aug. 30, 2026, finishing in 56:11.14, according to RunSignUp results.\nStrickland, listed as being from Zionsville, Indiana, was both the male and overall winner. Mindy Nicolet was the top female finisher, completing the triathlon in 1:01:59.99.\nBen Waite finished second in 57:13.87, and Mike Stanek was third in 57:21.76.",
